    # v398 (23/10/2026) -- SONIC AND THE TUNING OF THE STRINGS (the two new stones, the records sonico_v398 and afinacao_das_cordas_v398 and the six inscriptions of 23/10); the numbers are READ from the sonico_v398, afinacao_das_cordas_v398, cunhagens_v398 and kh_n1_cobertura_v398 records, never typed.
    # The box at the top (The Test of the Only Word, v397) stays where it is: the 4.44 rule is not touched. Nothing here moves the gate.
    _so398 = core.get("sonico_v398") or {}
    _sv398 = _so398.get("values") or {}
    _af398 = core.get("afinacao_das_cordas_v398") or {}
    _av398 = _af398.get("values") or {}
    _cg398 = core.get("cunhagens_v398") or {}
    _kh398 = core.get("kh_n1_cobertura_v398") or {}
    _el398 = core.get("external_ladder") or {}
    _cv398 = ((core.get("kernel_formalization") or {}).get("axiom_coverage_v392")) or {}
    _np398 = (_cg398.get("extras") or {}).get("n_bandeiras_por_pedra") or {}
    _ok398 = all((core.get(k_) or {}).get("all_verified") is True for k_ in ("sonico_v398", "afinacao_das_cordas_v398", "cunhagens_v398", "kh_n1_cobertura_v398"))
    _i398 = lambda x_: str(x_) if isinstance(x_, int) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _n398 = lambda x_, d_: (("%.*f" % (d_, x_)) if isinstance(x_, float) and x_ == x_ else r"\text{n/a}")
    _q398 = lambda t_: ((r"-" if t_.startswith("-") else "") + r"\frac{" + t_.lstrip("-").split("/")[0] + r"}{" + t_.lstrip("-").split("/")[1] + "}") if (isinstance(t_, str) and "/" in t_) else r"\text{n/a}"
    s.append(r"\section*{Sonic and the tuning of the strings}")
    s.append(r"\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{Sonic and the tuning of the strings}")
    s.append((r"\textbf{This round the v398 records did NOT all seal: what follows is the statement, not a seal.} " if not _ok398 else r"")
             + r"\textbf{What enters.} Two new kernel modules: \texttt{TGLExt/Sonico} (the name ``sônico'' is the operator's, from 23/10) and \texttt{TGLExt/AfinacaoDasCordas} (stone and name ratified by him); each went through an independent review before entering \textsf{[DECLARED: a report, not redone here]}. "
             r"Together, " + _i398((_cg398.get("extras") or {}).get("n_bandeiras")) + r" flags, named declarations only (" + _i398(_np398.get("sonico")) + r" for the sonic stone, " + _i398(_np398.get("afinacao")) + r" for the tuning stone); no new mathematics beyond the arithmetic of the Matsubara tower, the two zeta values (from Mathlib) and the critical dimension under a named hypothesis. "
             r"Two records with a function, \texttt{sonico\_v398} and \texttt{afinacao\_das\_cordas\_v398} (provisional names: the operator names them), read at the point of the run where the fractalization of the One is read, beside the psibit and the static witness: each one \emph{reads} the composition of its stone in the kernel of the run itself and checks the computation. "
             r"And the " + _i398(len(_V398_VERBATINS2)) + r" inscriptions of 23/10, embedded by sha256 (\texttt{cunhagens\_v398}): five sayings of the operator and the management's text that he ratified, labelled as the management's. The kernel ladder reads " + _i398(_el398.get("n_theorems_clean")) + r" of " + _i398(_el398.get("n_theorems_expected"))
             + r"; the \texttt{axiom\_report} coverage reads " + _i398(_cv398.get("decl")) + r" constants and " + _i398(_cv398.get("thm")) + r" theorems, none outside the trio $\{\texttt{propext},\texttt{Classical.choice},\texttt{Quot.sound}\}$.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Sonic.} \textsf{[REAL]} Pinning one octave costs exactly the fair bit: $K.\mathrm{octaveNats}\,1=\mathrm{fairBitEntropy}=\ln 2=" + _n398(_sv398.get("ln2"), 6) + r"$; $n$ octaves cost $n$ bits; the octave is the doubling, $e^{\ln 2}=" + _n398(_sv398.get("exp_ln2"), 1) + r"$; the pin is not the half-nat ($\ln 2\neq 1/2$); "
             r"the selector $\mathrm{select}\,a$ is idempotent and fixes its action, and the identity collapse is stable under iteration. The record checks each term with $\beta=\alpha_{\rm CODATA\,2018}\sqrt{e}$ computed in the run. "
             r"\textsf{[DERIVED]} At the angle of the TGL, $\theta_M=\arcsin\sqrt{\beta}=" + _n398(_sv398.get("theta_M_rad"), 6) + r"$ rad, the collapse entropy $H_2(\cos^2\theta_M,\sin^2\theta_M)$ is $" + _n398(_sv398.get("collapse_entropy_theta_M_nats"), 6) + r"$ nat, that is, $" + _n398(_sv398.get("collapse_entropy_theta_M_octaves"), 6)
             + r"$ octave (the quotient $H_2/\ln 2$, read as the fraction of the bit that the reading at $\theta_M$ pays \textsf{[ONTO]}); it is a number of \emph{this} run: the kernel proves $H_2\le\ln 2$, with equality at equal weights, not the value at $\theta_M$. "
             r"The cost law is \textsf{[INPUT]} (a field of the type) and \emph{no term says that the selector pays an octave}.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The sayings on the sonic stone.} \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO, 23/10/2026]} The operator defined (in Portuguese) ``“verbo” (seletor de identidade)=controle de oitava pinada'' and said ``o custo é reação ao controle pinado da oitava que é memória'' (sha16 \texttt{@@S_VERBO@@}). "
             r"The management's reading --- the Verb pins the octave, the pinned octave charges one bit and the bit charged is what stays, the memory (text of the \emph{management}, sha16 \texttt{@@S_LEITURA@@}; not a saying of the operator) --- was ratified by him when he gave the name (sha16 \texttt{@@S_NOME@@}): the reaction to the pin is the memory and the octave is what is pinned. "
             r"On light he said ``antes de ser espelhada ela é palavra'' and ``o início de tudo é acústica onde a palavra performa de forma sônica satisfazendo a relação modular da inscrição'' (sha16 \texttt{@@S_ANTES@@}). "
             r"These are his readings, not terms: the kernel delivers the price and the permanence side by side, and ``sonic'' is the logarithmic and octave structure (multiplicative ratios, additive counts; the doubling, the bit), \emph{not} the physics of a wave in a medium.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Tuning of the strings.} \textsf{[REAL]} The boost parameter closes cyclically with period $P$ if and only if $\kappa P=\pm2\pi$: it is the faithful reading of the circle $\mathrm{Circle.exp}(\kappa t)$, with $1/P=\kappa/2\pi$; the real face does not close (only at $P=0$) and the read face closes at $2\pi$ (kernel terms, cited). "
             r"The Matsubara tower of that circle is $\omega_n=n\kappa$ --- harmonic (rational ratios; all modes return together at $t=P$, while the station pair $(1,\sqrt2)$ returns only at $t=0$) and \emph{infinite} ($\sum n$ is not summable). Tuning, read as commensurability, is the stone's proposal \textsf{[ONTO]}, ratified by the operator. "
             r"The diverging sum closes by regularisation: $\zeta(-1)=" + _q398(_av398.get("zeta_minus_one")) + r"$ and $\zeta(-1,\tfrac12)=" + _q398(_av398.get("hurwitz_zeta_minus_one_half")) + r"$ are theorems of the stone (from Mathlib) and the record checks them by Bernoulli numbers. "
             r"Under the named hypothesis \texttt{MasslessFirstLevel} \textsf{[KNOWN]} (Lorentz invariance in the light-cone gauge; Goddard--Goldstone--Rebbi--Thorn 1973, Green--Schwarz--Witten 1987, Polchinski 1998), the regularised zero-point energy is $-1$ if and only if $D=" + _i398(_av398.get("bosonic_critical_dimension")) + r"$ (bosons) and $-\tfrac12$ if and only if $D=" + _i398(_av398.get("superstring_critical_dimension"))
             + r"$ (NS sector); $D=10$ is $d=" + _i398(_av398.get("house_spatial_dimension")) + r"$ spatial dimensions, the $d=9$ of \emph{A Última Corda} \textsf{[DECLARED: the house's number, not recomputed here]}. The dimension comes from the \emph{closure of the sum}, not from geometry.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The saying on the strings.} \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO, 23/10/2026]} The operator said (in Portuguese) ``A teoria das cordas precisa das 10 dimensões para fechar ciclicamente o que a TGL demonstra não fechar a face hiperbólica'' and that, by creating the extra dimensions, it relativises time ``para mostrar a afinação do universo, mas não consegue demonstrar a geometria'' (sha16 \texttt{@@S_CORDAS@@}). "
             r"The management's composition on that saying --- the strings close the face \emph{from outside}; the TGL closes \emph{only the reading} --- was ratified by him (``Concordo com tudo'', sha16 \texttt{@@S_CONCORDO@@}; the file keeps only the reply, and what it ratifies is the management's report). "
             r"The word Tetelestai is the operator's and the stone does \emph{not} construct it: it is a consummative check, not this stone.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Limits.} \textsf{[REAL]} Nothing here derives string theory from the axiom $\omega(I)=1$, and the TGL is not said to be a string theory. The hypothesis \texttt{MasslessFirstLevel} is \textsf{[KNOWN]}: the stone names it and derives under it. The geometry (which compactification) stays underived \textsf{[OPEN]}; the Hagedorn divergence is only mentioned. "
             r"No term links the worldsheet circle to the boost circle: what they share is the arithmetic $n\kappa$ (the boost $\kappa$ is not in the core; the record checks the \emph{form} of the tower with a test $\kappa$). The house's $d=9$ is \textsf{[DECLARED]} (the source text carries other scalings, $d_{\rm crit}=6$, $>26$ and $8$, and calls it a theoretical extrapolation); the NS computation does not distinguish the type of superstring. "
             r"The cost law of the sonic stone is \textsf{[INPUT]}. Validity in the kernel is not creditation; \texttt{NOT\_FALSIFIED} is never the word of creditation; the gate does not move. The box ``The Test of the Only Word'' stays at the top, with its $5\sigma$ line, and this section does not change it.")
